{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38172","headline":"再和大庆堂赐宴元璫而有诗呈吴越王 · 韩偓","name":"再和大庆堂赐宴元璫而有诗呈吴越王","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我有嘉宾宴乍欢，画帘纹细凤双盘。\n影笼沼沚修篁密，声透笙歌羯鼓乾。\n散後便依书箧寐，渴来潜想玉壶寒。\n樱桃零落红桃媚，更俟旬余共醉看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38172.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38172","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}